    title="performing_arts"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3ad.svg"> Ny kropp. Bedre vilk&#229;r. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129419;"
    title="butterfly"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f98b.svg"><img
